WEBVTT

1
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:11,110
so many people

2
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:13,530
The air inside is definitely not that good.

3
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:14,890
Just say a few words less

4
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:21,720
Xiaoxiao, please take a break and we'll watch.

5
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,660
It’s hard to sleep if it’s not safe enough

6
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:32,270
I can only get used to it slowly. I still have something to eat. Take it out.

7
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:42,380
Sister Xiaoxiao

8
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:45,060
Why do you carry an ax with you?

9
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:50,410
Used for body protection

10
00:00:54,290 --> 00:00:56,090
Why didn't I think of that before?

11
00:00:57,810 --> 00:00:59,810
We did forget to stock up on weapons
